OL,3,GNEWSA'Prisons losing battle on drugs',
OL,4,Ainquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has said prisons are fighting
OL,7,Fa losing battle with drugs after a
OL,8,Fprisoner died in jail.
OL,10,FWayne Miller, from Sunderland, was
OL,11,Fdiscovered in his cell after it is
OL,12,Fbelieved he swallowed drugs that were
OL,13,Fgiven to him by a visitor at HMP
OL,14,FFrankland in Durham, in December 2024.
OL,16,FA jury at Durham Coroners' Court in
OL,17,FCrook found that the 36-year-old's
OL,18,Fdeath was drug-related.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
