OL,3,GNEWSA'Prisons losing battle on drugs',
OL,4,Ainquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant coroner Simon Connolly, who
OL,7,Fissued a Prevention of Future Deaths
OL,8,FReport urging a more consistent
OL,9,Fapproach to the visitors' policy, said:
OL,10,F"The picture painted is one of prisons
OL,11,Ffighting a losing battle."
